    _do_movement_toward_pos()
    _do_flow_move()"]
    UNITLOOP --> TARGET["_update_target()"]
    UNITLOOP --> ATTACK["_do_attack()
    _do_attack_player()
    _do_combat()"]
    UNITLOOP --> ABIL["_update_ability()
    _activate_ability()"]
    UNITLOOP --> MORALE["_update_morale()
    rout / recovery / cascade"]
```

