> **Elder:** "If you gather me 10 pelts, I can make you something special, will you?"
> [Ok]
> **Elder:** "Return here with the pelts."

**Progress (< 10 pelts):**
> **Elder:** "Bring me those pelts young hero!"

**Complete (10+ pelts):**
> **Elder:** "Ah fantastic, give me a moment, there we go, one cloak!"
